							</video>

				<!-- Start Hero Inner -->
						<div id="service-hero-inner-CTRegister" >

				
							<div id="service-hero">
								<h1 data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500">Tokenisation for Regulated Markets:</h1>
								<img src="https://cleartoken.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/CT-Register-dark-background.png" class="tails" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500" />
				<h2 data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="800">Tokenise cash and assets and integrate with external blockchains through ClearToken's regulated financial market infrastructure</h2>

				
			</div> <!-- End Hero -->
			
			<div class="service-hero-arrow-down">
				<img src="https://cleartoken.io/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/arrow-down.png" alt="" width="726" height="141" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-383" data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-delay="1100" />
			</div>	
		</div><!-- End Hero Inner -->
						
		
			
			</div><!-- End Hero Container -->

			<div id="service-background-CTRegister">
				<div class="entry-content">
					<div id="services-hub-page-container">
						
									
						<div id="service-content-window">
							<h2>Tokenisation for Markets</h2>

<p class="para-header top-centre">CT Register provides the authoritative record of ownership for cash and digital assets, holding an immutable, real-time record of positions, offering:</p>

<ul class="service-centred-points ctregister-border">
	<li>tokenisation and de-tokenisation of fiat and digital assets</li>
	<li>24/7 market operation</li>
	<li>venue-agnostic, non-custodial solution</li>
	<li>horizontal, neutral market infrastructure </li>
</ul>

<p>CT Register enables the tokenisation and de-tokenisation of fiat, stablecoins and cryptoassets within ClearToken’s regulated FMI perimeter. Positions are reflected as data tokens, enabling programmable, auditable settlement workflows across CT Pay and CT Settle.</p>  

<p>Tokenisation of securities will be added in due course through ClearToken&#8217;s Central Securities Depository (CSD), subject to regulatory authorisation. ClearToken CSD Limited is a participant in the Bank of England’s Digital Securities Sandbox.</p>

<div id="service-key-pillars-column-layout">

<div class="service-key-pillars-column-left" style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(8, 9, 26, 1), rgba(8, 9, 26, 0.6) 35%, rgba(8, 9, 26, 0) 100%), url(https://cleartoken.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cross-bg-blue.png); background-repeat: repeat;">

<h4 style="text-align: center;">Key Features</h4>

<ul class="service-key-features">
	<li data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500">
<img decoding="async" src="https://cleartoken.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/blockchain_icon.png" alt="" />
<p>Tokenises fiat, stablecoins and securities (subject to regulatory approval)</p></li>
	<li data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="650">
<img decoding="async" src="https://cleartoken.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/computer_network_gradient_icon.png" alt="" />
<p>Enables tokenised assets to be reflected on external blockchain networks</p></li>
	<li data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="800">
<img decoding="async" src="https://cleartoken.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/institution_tick_icon.png" alt="" />
<p>Seamlessly reflects the golden source of truth from ClearToken cash and digital asset ledgers</p></li>

</ul>

</div>

<div class="service-key-pillars-column-right">
<h4 style="text-align: center;">Core Principles</h4>

<p class="para-header">CT Register enables tokenisation within ClearToken&#8217;s ecosystem, and integration with external blockchains.
</p>
<p>CT Settle offers two key principles:</p>


<ul class="service-key-pillars" style="text-align: center;">
	<li data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="300">
<img decoding="async" src="https://cleartoken.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/decentralised_icon.png" alt="" />
<div class="service-key-pillar-inner">
<div class="title">External blockchain integration:</div>
<p>Reflect tokenised assets on external blockchain networks.</p>
</div></li>

	<li data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="500">
<img decoding="async" src="https://cleartoken.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/bank_icon.png" alt="" />
<div class="service-key-pillar-inner">
<div class="title">Horizontal, neutral infrastructure:</div> 
<p>Platform agnosticism maximises cross-market liquidity and efficiencies.</p>
</div></li>


</ul>



</div>
</div>



<div class="service-page-section">

<h3>Regulatory Compliance</h3>
<p> ClearToken Depository Limited (‘ClearToken Depository’) is authorised by the FCA to operate CT Register, CT Pay and CT Settle. This includes:</p>


<ul class="arrow-bullets">
	<li>Authorisation to provide payment services in accordance with the Payment Services Regulations 2017</li>
	<li>Registration as a cryptoasset service provider in accordance with the Money Laundering, Terrorist Financing and Transfer of Funds (Information on the Payer) Regulations 2017.</li>

</ul>

<p>ClearToken will seek relevant regulatory status in every jurisdiction in which it operates and have strict requirements for participation to ensure that it is a trusted partner in the financial marketplace.</p>
</div>

<div class="service-page-section">

<h3>Contact</h3>

<p>Connect with our <a href="http://sales@cleartoken.io">Partnerships</a> team to learn how CT Register and ClearToken&#8217;s settlement network can support your firm&#8217;s digital asset trading.</p>

<div class="service-container-section">
<p style="font-style: italic">This service is provided by ClearToken Depository Limited, which is authorised by the Financial Conduct Authority (Firm Reference Number 1016940 and Firm Reference Number 1017352).</p>
</div>

</div>

							
							
							
														
						</div>


					</div>
				</div><!-- end entry-content -->
				
